RGB8_420_2P and RGB10_420_2P (540, 543) read as codes in place: the planes' texel buffer, the
reconstructed codes red Cr, green Y, blue Cb, each code / (2^b - 1), flagged by bit 11 of the
in-place conversion word (YCbCrInPlace::CODES); no planes image of the device's conversion.
WallpaperAerialsExtension's 4480x3088 RGB10_420_2P aerial frames otherwise had no texture.

